{"id":"n83602-1-7","stage":5,"title":"승마 · 骑马","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83602-1-7-1","ko":"사람들은 언제부터 말을 탔을까?","zh":"人们是从什么时候开始骑马的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람들은","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제부터","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말을","meaning":"马","explanation":"말：马；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53068","senseId":"1","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"탔을까?","meaning":"骑，坐","explanation":"타다：骑，坐；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"4","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"不知道的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"马","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"53068","definition":"身体主要呈褐色、黑色、白色，脸、颈、腿长，颈上有鬃，尾生长毛的动物。","pronunciation":["말"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"骑，坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"跨坐在人或物体上。","pronunciation":["타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a138d6cc74896fede728.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83602-1-7-2","ko":"글쎄, 몇천 년 전 벽화에도 승마 모습이 있는 걸 보면 아주 오래됐겠지?","zh":"嗯，从几千年前壁画上就有骑马的画面来看，应该是很久以前的事了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29723","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇천","meaning":"几；千，一千","explanation":"몇：几；천：千，一千","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"},{"term":"천","audio":"/audio/b201938cc759f55752b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"1","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"17167","senseId":"1","lemma":"천","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전","meaning":"以前","explanation":"전：以前","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벽화에도","meaning":"壁画","explanation":"벽화：壁画；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"벽화","audio":"/audio/a66cfef27f103307e7d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58215","senseId":"1","lemma":"벽화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승마","meaning":"骑马","explanation":"승마：骑马","readings":[{"term":"승마","audio":"/audio/95a11f9087922bc34d69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83602","senseId":"1","lemma":"승마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모습이","meaning":"样子，模样","explanation":"모습：样子，模样；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"모습","audio":"/audio/4b8858fa4bec51bc3aa6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62383","senseId":"1","lemma":"모습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"待着","explanation":"있다：待着；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸","meaning":"表示某人的所有物。","explanation":"거：表示某人的所有物。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"3","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보면","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오래됐겠지?","meaning":"久，老","explanation":"오래되다：久，老；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오래되다","audio":"/audio/7d268ef946cccd3a8e4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89515","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7ca52d3e5ceed208","term":"글쎄","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3","entryId":"29723","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"数目不定的小数字。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"b201938cc759f557","term":"천","zh":"千，一千","audio":"/audio/b201938cc759f55752b8.mp3","entryId":"17167","definition":"一百十倍的数量。","pronunciation":["천"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"以前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"过去的某时。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"a66cfef27f103307","term":"벽화","zh":"壁画","audio":"